/S /P
/ActualText (The IEEE Student Professional Awareness Conference \(SPAC\) is a national networking event that serves esteemed professionals and allows them to engage with engineering and computer science students within their fields. SPAC provides students, academics, and industry professionals with opportunities to network and bridge the gap between classrooms and boardrooms. It empowers attendees to build professional connections, gain career awareness, and explore job opportunities.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
