/T (IEEE Canada is the Canadian arm \(as Region 7\) of the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers \(IEEE\) as well as the constituent society of the Engineering Institute of Canada \(EIC\) for the technical fields of electrical, electronics, and computer engineering. The Ottawa Section represents more than 2000 individual members and serves to promote local events significant to Electrical, Computing, and Software Engineering. This year marks the 80th anniversary of IEEE Ottawa Section. )
