/ActualText (The IEEE Carleton University Student Branch, founded in 1975, is one of Canada's largest with over 400 members from various engineering, physics, and computer science programs. It hosts technical and non-technical events to help students advance their careers. Recently, they launched the Women in Engineering \(WIE\) affinity group to support more students. Visit us at https://ieeecarleton.ca.)
